WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:03.830
The beret now goes to the
seamstress.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.480
First she heats a black
cotton lining on a mould

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.790
to shape it to fit
perfectly inside the

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:15.480
beret. The lining has
the manufacturer's label

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.790
in the centre, which
features the company

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:22.140
crest and the model name
True Basque, confirming

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.990
that this is indeed an
authentic Basque style

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:31.590
beret. She turns the
beret inside out to sew

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:40.890
in the lining. Then she
turns the beret right

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:42.960
side out again and puts
it on a stretching

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:46.590
machine. She sets the
machine to the desired

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:49.170
hat size, and it
automatically stretches

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:51.000
the beret to that size.

